# WCAG Scanner backend.
# Production (Cloudflare Pages): served same-origin at /api/wcag-scan — no config.
#
# Local `vite dev` has no /api route, so point it at your DEPLOYED function.
# Copy this to .env.local and set your real domain (must include /api/wcag-scan):
# VITE_WCAG_WORKER_URL=https://<your-site>/api/wcag-scan
#
# CORS for localhost is already allowed by the function (localhost/127.0.0.1, any port).
